{"bangumi":{"date":"2006-10-02","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/5c/a4/10456_LfgX0.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/5c/a4/10456_LfgX0.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/5c/a4/10456_LfgX0.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/5c/a4/10456_LfgX0.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/5c/a4/10456_LfgX0.jpg"},"summary":"《甜蜜偶像》（らぶドル 〜Lovely Idol〜）是Enterbrain旗下杂志《Magi-Cu》（マジキュー）的读者参加企画，由杂志读者参与剧情和设定。其第二部《甜蜜偶像 -New Lyrics-》（らぶドル -NewLyrics-）属于Navel的，于2006年秋季被改编为电视动画。\r\n故事发生在一个名为“Sweetfish Production”的艺人事务所。该事务所以培养女性艺人（包括歌手、声优、演歌歌手、模特儿等）为主。之前已有两期的Love偶像，总共12人活跃在此事务所中。男主角──藤泽智弘为该事务所的经纪人。故事主轴围绕在六位女新人──榊瑞树、野野宫舞、桐生琴叶、北条比奈、藤泽琉璃和猫谷海羽──之间，并以她们六位作为“Sweetfish Production”事务所第三期学员。故事讲述着她们六位如何努力奋斗，并向前两期的前辈学习成为超人气艺人的情形。","name":"らぶドル ～Lovely Idol～","name_cn":"甜蜜偶像","tags":[{"name":"TV","count":44,"total_count":1393737},{"name":"甜蜜偶像","count":37,"total_count":37},{"name":"西又葵","count":33,"total_count":97},{"name":"后宫","count":32,"total_count":300847},{"name":"GAL改","count":25,"total_count":78169},{"name":"2006","count":23,"total_count":34080},{"name":"偶像","count":23,"total_count":71131},{"name":"AIC","count":21,"total_count":18220},{"name":"2006年10月","count":17,"total_count":2973},{"name":"补番","count":10,"total_count":10240},{"name":"TNK","count":9,"total_count":3933},{"name":"游戏改","count":9,"total_count":161785},{"name":"中原麻衣","count":9,"total_count":2858},{"name":"傲娇","count":8,"total_count":12807},{"name":"2006年","count":7,"total_count":1885},{"name":"日本","count":5,"total_count":292015},{"name":"川澄绫子","count":3,"total_count":1943},{"name":"音乐","count":3,"total_count":101881},{"name":"元永慶太郎","count":3,"total_count":779},{"name":"茅原实里","count":3,"total_count":1662},{"name":"游改","count":3,"total_count":2481},{"name":"季番","count":2,"total_count":8392},{"name":"ティー・エヌ・ケー","count":2,"total_count":175},{"name":"第一季","count":2,"total_count":1363},{"name":"野川樱","count":2,"total_count":26},{"name":"